      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('Rebuilt from the free Deribit chain (what Laevitas sells). The per-strike snapshot accumulates daily — context until ~6–12mo of history enables calibration.', '基于免费的 Deribit 期权链重建（即 Laevitas 所售）。逐行权价快照每日累积 — 在约 6–12 个月历史前仅作背景。') }}</div>
