      <div class="mini" style="margin-top:8px"><div class="lab"><span style="color:var(--r3)">{{ t('Headwind (score < −0.3)','逆风（评分 < −0.3）') }}</span><span><b>+1.4%</b> <span class="faint">/90d · 41% hit</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span style="color:var(--blue)">{{ t('Tailwind (score > +0.3)','顺风（评分 > +0.3）') }}</span><span><b>+48.8%</b> <span class="faint">/90d · 76% hit</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:10px">{{ t('It is a STRATEGIC (months-horizon) context gauge — kept separate from the tactical allocation, which it did not improve when tested as an overlay. Read it as the tide BTC swims in.', '这是战略层（数月维度）的背景指标 — 与战术仓位分开，因为作为叠加测试时并未改善回测。可将其理解为 BTC 所处的潮汐。') }}</div>
    </div>
