      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t('US/institutional demand proxy. CONTRARIAN at the extreme: a premium above +1.5% (FOMO) preceded −5.9%/90d at 36% hit — a measured TOP signal; 0 to +1.5% is the healthy-demand zone.', '美国/机构需求代理。极端时为反向信号：溢价高于 +1.5%（追高）后未来 90 天 −5.9%、胜率 36% — 实测的顶部信号；0 至 +1.5% 为健康需求区。') }}</div>
